    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) on 1 **PLATOON** unit of yours in **Engagement Range** of 1 or more enemy units. For the rest of that phase:\n\n- enemy units do not count as being in your unit's Engagement Range when ranged weapons pick targets\n- for each wound lost by an enemy model, if its unit is in your unit's Engagement Range, roll a D6: on a 4+, 1 model in your unit is **destroyed** once the attacking unit finishes its attacks",
